@tradition route-night
// SW2, 0.92.6 item 7(a), week 6 (FX17's shape: Wednesday 19:30, the chart room, Survey or Helm). Route night: every 8
// weeks from Day 38. Dev Raman spreads the week's route on the chart table and everyone puts a pin where they think the
// Wren will be in seven days; the nearest pin is read out at the next one (no prize but the reading out). Raman hosts.
k: 713
title: Route night
when: every 8 weeks wednesday week 6 from day 36
at: 19:30-20:20
min: 20
where: 2 room Chart room: lounge-seat, common-room
where: 2 room Observatory: common-room
hold: 1
who: raman always, helm 60%, survey 40%, stargazer 40%, everyone 10%
anim: talk
host: raman
from: raman
invite: host=raman odds=25% line="Route night in the chart room. Bring a guess. I'll bring the pins."

== mail
- Route night tomorrow, {time}, in the chart room. The week's route on the big table, and a pin for everyone: where will we be in seven days?

== ask
- Route night in the chart room. Put your pin in. Raman reads the closest out next time.
- Going to route night? Raman explains every turn. Slowly. Lovingly.   #funny

== here
- My pin's there. Don't move it.
- Raman says the turn's gentle. All his turns are gentle.   #funny
- Look how far we've come since the Line.

== thanks
- Raman spreads the week's route over the chart table. Everyone gets a pin, and puts it where they think the Wren will be in seven days.

== chatter
- I put my pin right on the dust. Raman winced.   #funny
- Route night's lovely. You can see the whole week on one table.
- My pin was the closest last time. Raman read it out and everything.   #warm
